section.p:
        Create an SCheckBox in the view and associate it with a boolean getter method in the model. 

        Below is an example of how to create the SCheckBox: 

// In the view: 
SCheckBox trueOrFalse = new SCheckBox(); 
trueOrFalse.setSelectorString("isChecked"); 

// In the model: 
private boolean isChecked = true; 
public boolean getIsChecked(){ 
  return isChecked; 
} 
public void setIsChecked(boolean check){ 
  isChecked = check; 
}
